	its own options with spec.looks (Base/init.luau). The City's notes follow. Nothing is sold: options unlock with Light (`glow`), Records
	(`record`) or the login streak (`daily`). Skin tones are never locked.
	Outfit features drawn by Engine/Avatar: shirt, pants, shoes, belt, apron, vest, tie, robe,
	buttons, collar, longcoat, cape, gloves, armband, sash.
	Accessory styles: sunglasses, glasses, roundglasses, monocle, mask, halfmask, visor,
	scarf, headband, earring, fedora. Eyes: color, and glow = true for augmented eyes.
	Weapons: a signature weapon drawn in the hand from 16 on (unless real gear is held).
	kind: knife, pole, pistol, sword, katana, greatsword, spear, axe, hammer, gauntlet,
	censer; color tints the blade or head, trim the guard or tassel.
	identities: premade characters the creator offers first (any locked pick falls back).
]]

